  "description": "The META SX V5 ESSENTIAL pedals to the summit and attacks the hardest lines back down with 165 mm of gravity DNA.\n• FOX 38 Performance fork (170 mm) paired with a FLOAT X Performance shock keeps composure through steep, high-impact terrain.\n• TRP DHR EVO PRO 4-piston brakes with 203/203 mm rotors give powerful, consistent stopping on long, gnarly descents.\n• DT SWISS E593 wheels and DT SWISS 370 hubs combine impact resistance, reliability and fast engagement.\n• SRAM Eagle 90 12-speed transmission with Eagle 70 cranks and 10-52t cassette shifts dependably under hard climbing loads.\nProgress your riding, one rowdy line at a time.",
